  m_text: 'We have discovered the human pastime of knitting. We wish to bring this
    craft back to our home planet. But we have no sheep. We need wool to make yarn.
    Get us a flock!


    Remember the rules: Nobody can witness us!


    To move
    the ship: W, A, S, D

    To use the tractor beam: Hold space


    The ship
    cannot stay cloaked while using the tractor beam. If you think someone will be
    able to see you, stop using the tractor beam!'
